# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building on the momentum established across the v2.x series, which has centered on positioning Qiskit as the leading platform for hybrid quantum-HPC workflows, [Qiskit SDK v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) delivers a significant expansion of the C API alongside faster, more flexible tools for building and optimizing quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "Membina atas momentum yang ditetapkan sepanjang siri v2.x, yang telah memberi tumpuan kepada memposisikan Qiskit sebagai platform terkemuka untuk aliran kerja hibrid kuantum-HPC, [Qiskit SDK v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) menyampaikan pengembangan besar API C bersama alat yang lebih pantas dan lebih fleksibel untuk membina dan mengoptimumkan litar kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Major updates include:\n"
msgstr "  Kemas kini utama termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom transpiler passes in C** - Write custom transpiler passes through Qiskit's C API using the new `QkDag` object and an expanded `QkTarget` object, which enable step-by-step inspection, modification, and extension of the compilation process - without rebuilding the entire compiler pipeline.\n"
msgstr "**Pas transpiler tersuai dalam C** - Tulis pas transpiler tersuai melalui API C Qiskit menggunakan objek `QkDag` baharu dan objek `QkTarget` yang dikembangkan, yang membolehkan pemeriksaan, pengubahsuaian, dan sambungan langkah demi langkah proses kompilasi - tanpa membina semula keseluruhan paip pengkompil.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Faster hardware layout selection** - Upgrades and Rust-driven performance enhancements to `VF2Layout` and `VF2PostLayout` improve the speed and scalability of circuit-to-hardware layout selection, reducing compilation overhead and improving fidelity on quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "**Pemilihan susun atur perkakasan lebih pantas** - Peningkatan dan peningkatan prestasi didorong Rust kepada `VF2Layout` dan `VF2PostLayout` meningkatkan kelajuan dan kebolehskalaan pemilihan susun atur litar-ke-perkakasan, mengurangkan overhed kompilasi dan meningkatkan fideliti pada perkakasan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New multi-qubit Pauli measurement** - The new `PauliProductMeasurement` instruction enables joint projective measurement across multiple qubits in a single operation, unlocking compilation to Pauli-based computation - a common representation in fault-tolerant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "**Pengukuran Pauli multi-qubit baharu** - Arahan `PauliProductMeasurement` baharu membolehkan pengukuran projektif bersama merentasi berbilang qubit dalam satu operasi tunggal, membuka kunci kompilasi kepada pengkomputeran berasaskan Pauli - satu perwakilan biasa dalam pengkomputeran kuantum toleran kesalahan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Improvements in early fault-tolerant transpilation** - Performance and feature enhancements for transpilation to early fault-tolerant targets - especially Clifford+T targets - help users more efficiently build transpilation pipelines for future QPUs.\n"
msgstr "**Penambahbaikan dalam transpilasi toleran kesalahan awal** - Peningkatan prestasi dan ciri untuk transpilasi kepada sasaran toleran kesalahan awal - terutamanya sasaran Clifford+T - membantu pengguna membina paip transpilasi dengan lebih cekap untuk QPU masa depan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  These capabilities give developers greater flexibility to customize quantum circuit optimizations and integrate with existing HPC workflows. [Visit the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) for the full technical summary.\n"
msgstr "  Keupayaan ini memberi pembangun fleksibiliti yang lebih besar untuk menyesuaikan pengoptimuman litar kuantum dan berintegrasi dengan aliran kerja HPC sedia ada. [Lawati blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) untuk ringkasan teknikal penuh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wondering what has changed? Read the [changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) and the [v2.3 release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.3).\n"
msgstr "Tertanya-tanya apa yang telah berubah? Baca [log perubahan](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) dan [nota pelancaran v2.3](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.3).\n"

